  "description": "Best Beach Cruiser Bike for Style and Performance\nIntroducing the Tracer Arcadia GT7 26\" Stretched Chopper Bike, a beach cruiser bike that's the perfect blend of style and performance. The Hi-ten stretch steel frame sets the stage for a sleek and elongated profile, capturing the essence of chopper aesthetics. Equipped with a Shimano 7-speed system, this cruiser ensures versatility in tackling various terrains with ease.The Triple Tree Fork adds to the allure, providing stability and a smooth ride. The inclusion of a reliable disc brake system enhances braking precision and control, ensuring safety during your rides. The HI-RISE type handlebar not only complements the chopper design but also offers a comfortable and commanding riding position.Designed for optimal pedaling efficiency, the three-piece crank features an arm length of 170mm, coupled with a 46T chainwheel with a Cr-Mo axle. The front alloy 3-spoke wheel contributes to both the bike's aesthetic appeal and overall durability.Whether you're cruising through city streets or embarking on leisurely rides, the 26\" Chopper Cruiser Stretch Bikes deliver a harmonious fusion of style, functionality, and comfort for a memorable cycling experience.",
